  "nativeAdaptations": [
    "No synthetic PointerEvent or browser import: pointer/key/native activation retain original event objects; point metadata uses finite native page coordinates or requests the actual public native-ref rectangle for coordinate-free activation",
    "Existing native Enter/Space capture/default-handled policy replaces browser Enter-to-synthetic-pointer dispatch. Actual key defaults, focus modality, bounds and native fidelity still require proof",
    "Current source priority state drives the real value backend; callbacks run postRender and carry attachment/window/epoch leases; original native responder negotiation and caller callbacks are preserved",
    "Held hover leave is deferred until native pointer release/cancel; reentry starts again and clears the deferral, matching the inspected pinned source",
    "Same native root/ref/editor survives interaction prop changes; no accessible grouping, editor methods/values/selection changes or SDK flag changes are introduced"
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Actual native primary/secondary/multitouch/hover delivery and held release outside the native root/window",
    "Native pointer-release versus Android-click arbitration without duplicate activation",
    "Global tap target, authored tap propagation and cross-owner drag lock; current source only suppresses own active drag",
    "Actual native Enter/Space/default delivery, accessibility activation, focus-visible modality, real rectangle and nested editor responder behavior",
    "Full Pan/drag/viewport/layout/projection/presence and complete Card/API/current consumer/products/adaptive/performance/closure requirements"
  ]
}
